# Shared build context for cloud/Dockerfile and frontend/Dockerfile (Railway
# builds both from the repository root). Keep build output, local stores,
# secrets and large validation records out; each Dockerfile copies only what
# it needs. Built programs come from their Dockerfile stage, never artifacts/.
.git
target
**/target
node_modules
dist
test-results
playwright-report
.analysis-runs
.eplyx
**/.eplyx
artifacts
reports/milestone*
frontend/public/vendor
frontend/public/evidence
**/*keypair*.json
**/credentials.json
**/*.env
.env*
